I always have my luckstone at y (and in the early game I'll put some
stupid gem or something there). I guess this could quickly turn into
YA "what do you place at each inventory slot" thread.

A/B/C/G/H/T/S - Armor/Boots/Cloak/etc
L - ring of levitation
K - ring of conflict
E - ring of telecontrol
F - ring of free action

a - primary weapon
b - blindfold/towel
c - secondary weapon
e - pickaxe
j - lizard corpse
k - key/lockpick/credit card
l - unicorn horn
o - bag/sack
q - primary thrown ammo
w - magic whistle
y - luckstone
z - lamp

Some of these make sense letter-wise, others are customary for weird
but in-game reasons (e.g. archaeologists usually start with the pick-
axe at e, so I got used to it there).  Others are just personal foible
(I think the first time I found a BoH it happened to be at o).



